Cell["\<\
These are examples... There\[CloseCurlyQuote]s so much to be played with once \
we make our simulation. Even controlling how genes are passed down or the \
starting distributions of those genes are possibilities!\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.977753012476*^9, 
  3.9777531777385273`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"aeba584b-25ee-4540-8b98-\
043f4680aee6"]
