Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Evolutionary Game Theory Modeling of Parenting Behaviors", \
"Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9777546965305557`*^9, 
  3.9777546994299545`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5d66a0a4-a6cc-1b48-9ada-\
68cf8e33803d"],

Cell["\<\
\tParenting behaviors will be modeled using Evolutionary Game Theory. \
Specifically, interactions between parents and their children will be modeled \
with reward matrices. Children will either be in one or two situations: above \
a specific energy threshold, or below that threshold. The parent will be able \
to make one of two decisions, and the decision they make will be \
deterministic based off there parenting allele. Parents can either feed their \
children, or lead them to starve. One example of such a reward matrix may \
look like this:

reward matrix...

Parenting behavior alleles that we will introduce:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97775470496834*^9, 3.977754832313711*^9}, {
  3.9777548834242783`*^9, 
  3.977754925472004*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5bf1d58b-0489-034b-9b90-\
ebf72c37eacb"],

Cell["\<\
Base strategy: my children do not exist -- I only care about myself, so I \
will always choose STARVE, no matter what\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97775494969705*^9, 
  3.97775497705122*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c9efe1c2-57ad-6b49-8835-\
759cea4e1042"],

Cell["\<\
Loving parent: always FEED all my children equally no matter what\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97775494969705*^9, 3.977755001942814*^9}, {
  3.9777550371849327`*^9, 
  3.9777550397503757`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f4384a61-c521-8749-877e-\
a6099fce6b07"],

Cell["\<\
Practical parent: only FEED my children accordingly, if they are STARVING\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97775494969705*^9, 3.9777550066887608`*^9}, {
  3.977755044043049*^9, 
  3.977755049269331*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d073edda-531c-5442-a190-\
28021c9ab5ac"],

Cell["\<\
Favoritism parent: only FEED the children that are able to find food. STARVE \
the children that aren\[CloseCurlyQuote]t able to (the excess energy converts \
into improved well-being of the children, while the children that are \
starving merely survive)\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97775494969705*^9, 3.977755005366556*^9}, {
  3.9777550553144016`*^9, 
  3.977755118163887*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"02ded27f-5998-6747-9332-\
e52bc0b28c02"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

